  "summary": {
    "text": "Claude is a language model that Anthropic introduced in March 2023 together with the lighter Claude Instant, after a closed alpha with partners including Notion, Quora and DuckDuckGo. Businesses could request access through a chat interface and the API in Anthropic's developer console; in May 2023 Anthropic raised its context window from 9K to 100K tokens.",
